# Cluster credentials and secrets - NEVER commit these
CLUSTERS.md
pull-secret.json
*/auth/
**/kubeconfig
**/kubeadmin-password
**/*.key
**/*.crt

# OpenShift installer generated files
**/.openshift_install*
**/.clusterapi_output/
**/terraform.*.json
**/metadata.json

# Logs
**/*.log

# Backup files
**/*.backup
**/*.old

# Keep only the necessary config files
!*/deployments/*.yaml
!*/demo/*.sh
!*/demo/*.py
!*/demo/*.html
!maas-test/*.yaml
!maas-test/*.sh
!hub-tls/*.yaml
!*.md
!*.sh
